OL,3,GNEWSA'I wasn't thinking straight' says
OL,4,Afive jobs civil servant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA civil servant accused of fraudulently
OL,7,Fjuggling multiple public sector jobs
OL,8,Fhas told the court he "wasn't thinking
OL,9,Fstraight" when he allegedly misled
OL,10,Ffuture bosses about his employment
OL,11,Fstatus.
OL,13,FKashim Chowdhury said he was "in a
OL,14,Fpanic" when he applied for a job at the
OL,15,FDepartment of Health (DHSC), failing to
OL,16,Fdeclare he was already working at the
OL,17,FDepartment for the Environment (Defra).
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
