OL,3,GNEWSA'I wasn't thinking straight' says
OL,4,Afive jobs civil servant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prosecution said he already had
OL,7,Fthree full-time jobs at the time,
OL,8,Fincluding roles at the London Borough
OL,9,Fof Tower Hamlets and East London NHS
OL,10,FTrust.
OL,12,FThe 55-year-old, who is from east
OL,13,FLondon, is on trial accused of nine
OL,14,Fcounts of fraud. He denies acting
OL,15,Fdishonestly or intending to make a
OL,16,Fdishonest gain.
